NT47 -> NT21 NT3, NT1 -> NT5 NT77, NT66 -> NT52 NT63, NT64 -> NT84 NT62, NT53 -> NT86 NT33, NT7 -> NT66 NT48, NT33 -> NT84 NT81, NT38 -> NT34 NT27, NT12 -> NT82 NT48, NT5 -> NT68 NT3, NT38 -> NT63 NT96, NT14 -> NT33 NT27, NT96 -> NT54 NT53, NT39 -> NT70 NT39, NT24 -> NT38 NT70, NT98 -> NT78 NT14, NT47 -> NT1 NT62, NT75 -> NT98 NT26, NT53 -> NT39 NT80, NT70 -> NT84 NT36, NT27 -> NT24 NT62, NT3 -> NT22 NT74, NT68 -> NT47 NT12, NT97 -> NT43 NT75, NT84 -> NT4 NT1

**CYK Table Calculation:**

**1. Substrings of Length 1 (i.e., `P[i][i]`):**
*   `P[1][1]` (`t3`): {NT68, NT35, NT12, NT26, NT80, NT22, NT54, NT77, NT74, NT96}
*   `P[2][2]` (`t1`): {NT63, NT47, NT98, NT48, NT33, NT54, NT81, NT77, NT4}
*   `P[3][3]` (`t4`): {NT54, NT64, NT66, NT96, NT47, NT36, NT22, NT82, NT21, NT52, NT34}
*   `P[4][4]` (`t4`): {NT54, NT64, NT66, NT96, NT47, NT36, NT22, NT82, NT21, NT52, NT34}
*   `P[5][5]` (`t1`): {NT63, NT47, NT98, NT48, NT33, NT54, NT81, NT77, NT4}
*   `P[6][6]` (`t4`): {NT54, NT64, NT66, NT96, NT47, NT36, NT22, NT82, NT21, NT52, NT34}
*   `P[7][7]` (`t4`): {NT54, NT64, NT66, NT96, NT47, NT36, NT22, NT82, NT21, NT52, NT34}
*   `P[8][8]` (`t1`): {NT63, NT47, NT98, NT48, NT33, NT54, NT81, NT77, NT4}

**2. Substrings of Length 2 (`P[i][i+1]`):**
*   `P[1][2]` (`t3 t1`): (Check `A -> BC` where B in `P[1][1]`, C in `P[2][2]`)
    *   No rule A -> BC where B from P[1][1] and C from P[2][2].
    *   Example check: `S -> NT35 NT84`. NT35 is in `P[1][1]`, but NT84 is not in `P[2][2]`.
    *   Example check: `NT5 -> NT68 NT3`. NT68 is in `P[1][1]`, but NT3 is not in `P[2][2]`.
    *   `P[1][2]` = {}

*   `P[2][3]` (`t1 t4`): (Check `A -> BC` where B in `P[2][2]`, C in `P[3][3]`)
    *   `NT38 -> NT63 NT96`: NT63 in `P[2][2]`, NT96 in `P[3][3]`. -> {NT38}
    *   `P[2][3]` = {NT38}

*   `P[3][4]` (`t4 t4`): (Check `A -> BC` where B in `P[3][3]`, C in `P[4][4]`)
    *   `S -> NT64 NT96`: NT64 in `P[3][3]`, NT96 in `P[4][4]`. -> {S}
    *   `NT3 -> NT22 NT74`: NT22 in `P[3][3]`, NT74 in `P[4][4]`. -> {NT3}
    *   `P[3][4]` = {S, NT3}

*   `P[4][5]` (`t4 t1`): (Check `A -> BC` where B in `P[4][4]`, C in `P[5][5]`)
    *   `NT66 -> NT52 NT63`: NT52 in `P[4][4]`, NT63 in `P[5][5]`. -> {NT66}
    *   `P[4][5]` = {NT66}

*   `P[5][6]` (`t1 t4`): (Check `A -> BC` where B in `P[5][5]`, C in `P[6][6]`)
    *   `NT38 -> NT63 NT96`: NT63 in `P[5][5]`, NT96 in `P[6][6]`. -> {NT38}
    *   `P[5][6]` = {NT38}

*   `P[6][7]` (`t4 t4`): (Check `A -> BC` where B in `P[6][6]`, C in `P[7][7]`)
    *   `S -> NT64 NT96`: NT64 in `P[6][6]`, NT96 in `P[7][7]`. -> {S}
    *   `NT3 -> NT22 NT74`: NT22 in `P[6][6]`, NT74 in `P[7][7]`. -> {NT3}
    *   `P[6][7]` = {S, NT3}

*   `P[7][8]` (`t4 t1`): (Check `A -> BC` where B in `P[7][7]`, C in `P[8][8]`)
